[36m(TaskRunner pid=490033)[0m - 567 → Ends in 7 → Invalid
[36m(TaskRunner pid=490033)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=490033)[0m Valid candidates: $1, 21, 81$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=490033)[0m 
