[36m(TaskRunner pid=490033)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=490033)[0m ### **Step 5: Verify These Divisors Are Actually Divisors of $9!$**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=490033)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=490033)[0m - 1 divides every number.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=490033)[0m - 21 = $3 \times 7$, and both 3 and 7 are in the prime factorization of 9!.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=490033)[0m - 81 = $3^4$, and 9! has $3^4$, so this is a valid divisor.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=490033)[0m 
